  "description": "Variation of condition 1 (Approved Plans) of planning permission 20/2576/S73 dated 23/07/2024 for 'Redevelopment of the site and erection of building between 4 to 8 storey's for a mixed use development comprising 28 residential dwellings, and flexible uses at ground floor comprising of A1/A3/D1/D2 floorspace with associated works, landscaping and parking at lower ground levels.' Variation to include provision of a 2-storey car park with car lifts; alterations to internal layouts; alterations to facades and materials; Alterations to courtyard and ground floor amenities and roof terraces including a landscape and drainage strategy'. Variation to include enhancements to ventilation, energy efficiency, fire safety, and acoustic performance; improved access and visual impact through equipment relocation; optimized roof and play spaces; added conservatories and landscaping for noise mitigation and amenity; and internal layout revisions",
